&lt;li&gt;Remove service bus distributed trace header manipulation from Azure Function instrumentation. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/issues/3274" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/pull/3274/hovercard"&gt;#3274&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href="https://github.com/newrelic/newrelic-dotnet-agent/commit/e21eca052261b415a8b194d917d11455a3b38a68"&gt;e21eca0&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
